  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large raclette-grill over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the garam masala, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper (if using), salt, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the mulukhiyah leaves and cook until wilted, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the dried prunes and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the parsley and lemon juice.",
    "Transfer the tagine to a serving dish and serve immediately."
